>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `CS_SAFE_TAC`

``` hol4
classicalLib.CS_SAFE_TAC : clasetLib.claset -> NTactical.ntactic
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Constructs the claset-explicit form of `SAFE_TAC`.

`CS_SAFE_TAC cs` repeatedly applies matching safe steps to every open goal
until saturation. It returns the resulting state through
`NTactical.ntactic`, without committing to one result or processing
theorem-list markers.

### Failure

Produces no result when safe saturation leaves the state unchanged.

